/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, June to July came in under 90% of normal in 34 of those years. In 2025, August to September came in at 51% of normal on the middle, and so far in 2026 March to April sits at 190%. Grid 27812 had its driest year in 1957, at 71% of normal.</p>"}
